    <string name="ussd_accessibility_service_description">A service to fetch and store data about the
        available balance; besides of the status of bonuses and available packets.

        \n\nThis service is in charge of scanning the content of the dialog that appears on the screen
        after making a consult, in search of information related with the amount of balance available,
        the remaining call minutes, the amount of SMS still left, existing bonuses and, basically, to
        summarize, all the information consulted through the application when performing an operation.
        All the obtained data is stored exclusively on this device and is only used to be shown in the
        main screen of the application.

        \n\nPlease notice that when you enable this service, the system might warn you about that STK has
        access and control over the content on the screen. This happens because in order to get access
        to the required data, the content of the screen needs to be scanned; but STK only inspects
        the dialogs generated as response for the consults associated with ETECSA\'s services in
        search of the aforementioned information, ignoring any other content and without intervening
        with user actions.
    </string>

